<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Lotf Ali Khan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">executed <a href="/years/1794">1794</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Lotf Ali Khan was the last ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zand-dynasty">Zand Empire</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a>. A brave and capable soldier, he resisted the rising <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qajar-dynasty">Qajar</a> leader Agha Mohammad Khan for several years. He was captured at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kerman">Kerman</a> and executed in 1794, ending the Zand dynasty and opening the way for Qajar rule.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/lotf-ali-khan.jpg" alt="Lotf Ali Khan" width="320" height="340" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nimazandyf · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lotfali_khan_zand2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
